"<div id=""mindx-therapeutic-readiness"">

  <h2>Therapeutic Readiness &amp; Engagement Estimator</h2>

  <div class=""subtitle"">
    Quickly assess a client's current readiness for therapeutic work and identify areas that may benefit from additional support.
  </div>


  <!-- Question 1 -->

  <div class=""question"">

    <label>
      How clearly can the client identify a reason for seeking therapy or making a change?
    </label>

    <select id=""tr-q1"">

      <option value=""0"">
        The client is unsure or does not identify a current need for change
      </option>

      <option value=""1"">
        The client has some concerns but goals remain unclear
      </option>

      <option value=""2"">
        The client can identify general areas they would like to address
      </option>

      <option value=""3"">
        The client has clear and meaningful treatment goals
      </option>

    </select>

  </div>


  <!-- Question 2 -->

  <div class=""question"">

    <label>
      How willing is the client to participate in the therapeutic process?
    </label>

    <select id=""tr-q2"">

      <option value=""0"">
        Significant reluctance or resistance
      </option>

      <option value=""1"">
        Ambivalent or uncertain
      </option>

      <option value=""2"">
        Generally willing with some hesitation
      </option>

      <option value=""3"">
        Actively willing to participate
      </option>

    </select>

  </div>


  <!-- Question 3 -->

  <div class=""question"">

    <label>
      How engaged has the client been during sessions?
    </label>

    <select id=""tr-q3"">

      <option value=""0"">
        Minimal engagement
      </option>

      <option value=""1"">
        Inconsistent engagement
      </option>

      <option value=""2"">
        Generally engaged
      </option>

      <option value=""3"">
        Consistently engaged and collaborative
      </option>

    </select>

  </div>


  <!-- Question 4 -->

  <div class=""question"">

    <label>
      How open is the client to exploring thoughts, emotions, behaviors, relationships, or patterns?
    </label>

    <select id=""tr-q4"">

      <option value=""0"">
        Currently very limited
      </option>

      <option value=""1"">
        Some openness but significant hesitation
      </option>

      <option value=""2"">
        Generally open to exploration
      </option>

      <option value=""3"">
        Actively curious and willing to explore
      </option>

    </select>

  </div>


  <!-- Question 5 -->

  <div class=""question"">

    <label>
      How willing is the client to consider new perspectives, skills, or strategies?
    </label>

    <select id=""tr-q5"">

      <option value=""0"">
        Not currently willing
      </option>

      <option value=""1"">
        Unsure or reluctant
      </option>

      <option value=""2"">
        Willing with support
      </option>

      <option value=""3"">
        Actively interested in trying new approaches
      </option>

    </select>

  </div>


  <!-- Question 6 -->

  <div class=""question"">

    <label>
      How consistently has the client followed through with agreed-upon treatment activities or goals?
    </label>

    <select id=""tr-q6"">

      <option value=""0"">
        Little or no follow-through
      </option>

      <option value=""1"">
        Inconsistent follow-through
      </option>

      <option value=""2"">
        Generally follows through
      </option>

      <option value=""3"">
        Consistently follows through
      </option>

    </select>

  </div>


  <!-- Question 7 -->

  <div class=""question"">

    <label>
      Are there current barriers that may interfere with therapeutic engagement?
    </label>

    <select id=""tr-q7"">

      <option value=""0"">
        Significant barriers are currently present
      </option>

      <option value=""1"">
        Several barriers may affect participation
      </option>

      <option value=""2"">
        Some manageable barriers are present
      </option>

      <option value=""3"">
        Few significant barriers are currently identified
      </option>

    </select>

  </div>


  <!-- Question 8 -->

  <div class=""question"">

    <label>
      How well does the client understand and agree with the current treatment plan?
    </label>

    <select id=""tr-q8"">

      <option value=""0"">
        Limited understanding or significant disagreement
      </option>

      <option value=""1"">
        Some understanding but substantial uncertainty
      </option>

      <option value=""2"">
        Generally understands and agrees
      </option>

      <option value=""3"">
        Clearly understands and collaborates on the plan
      </option>

    </select>

  </div>


  <!-- Question 9 -->

  <div class=""question"">

    <label>
      How comfortable is the client with discussing challenges or providing feedback about therapy?
    </label>

    <select id=""tr-q9"">

      <option value=""0"">
        Very uncomfortable or avoids discussion
      </option>

      <option value=""1"">
        Somewhat hesitant
      </option>

      <option value=""2"">
        Generally comfortable
      </option>

      <option value=""3"">
        Comfortable and willing to communicate openly
      </option>

    </select>

  </div>


  <!-- Question 10 -->

  <div class=""question"">

    <label>
      How realistic and collaborative are the client's current expectations for therapy?
    </label>

    <select id=""tr-q10"">

      <option value=""0"">
        Expectations appear significantly mismatched or unrealistic
      </option>

      <option value=""1"">
        Expectations need substantial clarification
      </option>

      <option value=""2"">
        Expectations are generally realistic
      </option>

      <option value=""3"">
        Expectations are realistic and collaboratively developed
      </option>

    </select>

  </div>


  <button
    type=""button""
    onclick=""calculateTherapeuticReadiness()"">

    Assess Therapeutic Readiness

  </button>


  <div id=""therapeutic-readiness-result""></div>


  <div class=""note"">
    This tool is intended for clinical reflection and treatment planning. It is not a diagnostic instrument and does not replace clinical judgment, ongoing assessment, or collaborative treatment planning.
  </div>

</div>


<style>

